    "Id": "chassisdef_shadowhawk_SHD-3K",
    "Name": "Shadow Hawk",
    "Details": "Based on the 2K, this 3075 variant carries a heavy PPC, MML-5, and ER medium laser. CASE protects the missile ammunition, while heavy ferro-fibrous armor covers the 'Mech. Additionally, a C3 slave unit is installed to provide targeting data to friendly units. The heat sinks are upgraded to double-strength models.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Battle Fists</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>",
